{"slug":"tests","title":"Контрольные работы","subtitle":"по контрольной на каждый урок и большая итоговая по всему курсу","steps":false,"sections":[{"id":"t1","nav":"К1 · to be","eyebrow":"Контрольная 1 · урок 1","title":"Глагол to be","theory":"<p>Проверка по уроку <b>1 «Глагол to be»</b>. Новые задания, которых не было в уроке.</p>\n<p><b>Что проверяем:</b> am / is / are · отрицания · вопросы и короткие ответы · where / what / how · порядок слов · страны · its / it's · -ing / -ed · перевод · was / were</p>\n<p>Решайте без подсказок и не открывайте объяснения. Итог внизу страницы покажет, сколько решено с первой попытки. Ошибки попадут в «Мои ошибки», их можно перерешать.</p>","groups":[{"title":"Часть A · выберите","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"My cousins ___ from Brazil.","o":["am","is","are"],"a":"are","ex":"cousins = they → are."},{"t":"choice","q":"The weather ___ terrible today.","o":["am","is","are"],"a":"is","ex":"weather = it → is."},{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ not ready yet.","o":["am","is","are"],"a":"am","ex":"I → am."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ your office far from here?","o":["Am","Is","Are"],"a":"Is","ex":"office = it → Is."},{"t":"choice","q":"Are you and Kate sisters? — Yes, ___.","o":["we are","we're","they are"],"a":"we are","ex":"you and Kate → we. Короткое «да» без сокращения."},{"t":"choice","q":"Is the museum open on Mondays? — No, ___.","o":["it isn't","it not","isn't"],"a":"it isn't","ex":"No, it isn't."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ is your birthday? — In May.","o":["Where","When","Who"],"a":"When","ex":"In May — когда → When."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ are you from? — I'm from Kazan.","o":["What","Where","How"],"a":"Where","ex":"Откуда → Where … from."},{"t":"choice","q":"He's from Sweden. He's ___.","o":["Swedish","Swedian","Swede's"],"a":"Swedish","ex":"Sweden → Swedish."},{"t":"choice","q":"The hotel is famous for ___ view.","o":["it's","its"],"a":"its","ex":"Чей вид? Отеля → its."},{"t":"choice","q":"I'm ___ in art.","o":["interesting","interested"],"a":"interested","ex":"Мне интересно → I'm interested."},{"t":"choice","q":"«Мне скучно.»","o":["I'm bored.","I'm boring.","Me is boring."],"a":"I'm bored.","ex":"Состояние человека → bored."},{"t":"choice","q":"I ___ at home yesterday.","o":["am","was","were"],"a":"was","ex":"yesterday → прошлое, I → was."},{"t":"choice","q":"Look! The children ___ playing in the snow.","o":["is","are","—"],"a":"are","ex":"Прямо сейчас: are + playing."}]},{"title":"Часть B · напишите","items":[{"t":"input","q":"They are at the office.","a":["They aren't at the office.","They are not at the office.","They're not at the office."],"ex":"are → aren't.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"input","q":"Your brother is married.","a":["Is your brother married?"],"ex":"Is + your brother + married?","p":"Превратите в вопрос"},{"t":"input","q":"«Мне 30 лет.»","a":["I'm 30.","I am 30.","I'm 30 years old.","I am 30 years old.","I'm thirty.","I am thirty."],"ex":"Возраст — через to be.","p":"Переведите на английский"},{"t":"input","q":"«Где твои ключи?»","a":["Where are your keys?"],"ex":"keys → are.","p":"Переведите на английский"}]},{"title":"Часть C · найдите ошибку и соберите","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"My parents is on holiday.","w":2,"c":"are","ex":"parents = they → are."},{"t":"fix","q":"I amn't hungry.","w":1,"c":"am not","ex":"Формы amn't нет: I'm not / I am not."},{"t":"order","w":["film","what","your","is","favourite"],"a":["What is your favourite film?"],"ex":"What + is + your favourite film?"},{"t":"order","w":["it","very","is","cold","today"],"a":["It is very cold today."],"ex":"It + is + very cold + today."}]},{"title":"Часть D · знакомство и фразы с доски (темы 11–12)","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"A: This is my brother, Tom. B: ___","o":["Nice to meet you.","Nice meeting to you.","I meet you."],"a":"Nice to meet you.","ex":"Nice to meet you."},{"t":"choice","q":"«Я из России, я русский.»","o":["I'm from Russia. I'm Russian.","I'm from Russian. I'm Russia.","I from Russia. I Russian."],"a