he cat is eating. ___ food is in the kitchen.","o":["It's","Its","Her"],"a":"Its","ex":"Кошка → its."},{"t":"choice","q":"That laptop isn't ___. It's my brother's.","o":["my","mine","me"],"a":"mine","ex":"Без предмета → mine."},{"t":"choice","q":"Is this scarf ___, Anna?","o":["your","yours","you"],"a":"yours","ex":"Без предмета → yours."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ car is this? — It's Mike's.","o":["Who","Who's","Whose"],"a":"Whose","ex":"Чья? → Whose."},{"t":"choice","q":"This is my ___ room. (у меня две сестры, комната общая)","o":["sister's","sisters'","sisters's"],"a":"sisters'","ex":"Две сёстры: sisters + ' → sisters'."},{"t":"choice","q":"It's raining. Let's stay ___.","o":["outside","inside"],"a":"inside","ex":"Дождь → останемся внутри."},{"t":"choice","q":"These gloves aren't ours. They're ___. (Tom and Lisa)","o":["their","theirs","them"],"a":"theirs","ex":"they → theirs."}]},{"title":"Часть B · напишите","items":[{"t":"input","q":"This is Kate's notebook. → This notebook is ___.","a":["hers"],"ex":"Kate → she → hers.","p":"Впишите одно слово","h":"she → h…"},{"t":"input","q":"That is my key.","a":["Those are my keys."],"ex":"that → those, is → are, key → keys.","p":"Напишите про несколько предметов"},{"t":"input","q":"(these / sunglasses)","a":["Whose sunglasses are these?","Whose are these sunglasses?"],"ex":"Whose + sunglasses + are + these?","p":"Спросите: «Чьи это очки?»"},{"t":"input","q":"Are these your gloves?","a":["Are these yours?","Are they yours?"],"ex":"your gloves → yours.","p":"Замените с помощью mine, yours, hers…"}]},{"title":"Часть C · найдите ошибку и соберите","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"Who's bag is this?","w":0,"c":"Whose","ex":"Чья? → Whose."},{"t":"fix","q":"This are my keys.","w":0,"c":"These","ex":"keys — несколько → These are."},{"t":"fix","q":"Is this pen your?","w":3,"c":"yours","ex":"Без предмета → yours."},{"t":"order","w":["is","whose","on","the","table","wallet"],"a":["Whose wallet is on the table?"],"ex":"Whose wallet + is + on the table?"},{"t":"order","w":["that","father's","is","car","my"],"a":["That is my father's car."],"ex":"my father's + car."}]}]},{"id":"t3","nav":"К3 · have got","eyebrow":"Контрольная 3 · урок 3","title":"have got — у меня есть","theory":"<p>Проверка по уроку <b>3 «have got»</b>. Новые задания, которых не было в уроке.</p>\n<p><b>Что проверяем:</b> have got / has got · haven't got · Have you got…? и короткие ответы · have и do you have · 's = is или has · прилагательные · everything / everybody</p>\n<p>Решайте без подсказок и не открывайте объяснения. Итог внизу страницы покажет, сколько решено с первой попытки. Ошибки попадут в «Мои ошибки», их можно перерешать.</p>","groups":[{"title":"Часть A · выберите","items":[{"t":"choice","q":"My grandparents ___ a small house in the country.","o":["have got","has got"],"a":"have got","ex":"grandparents = they → have got."},{"t":"choice","q":"Anna ___ long dark hair.","o":["have got","has got"],"a":"has got","ex":"Anna = she → has got."},{"t":"choice","q":"He's got two cars. — 's = ___","o":["is","has"],"a":"has","ex":"'s + got → has."},{"t":"choice","q":"He's very tall. — 's = ___","o":["is","has"],"a":"is","ex":"got нет → is."},{"t":"choice","q":"We ___ any bread. Can you buy some?","o":["haven't got","hasn't got"],"a":"haven't got","ex":"we → haven't got."},{"t":"choice","q":"___ your brother got a girlfriend?","o":["Have","Has","Does"],"a":"Has","ex":"brother = he → Has."},{"t":"choice","q":"Have you got a pet? — No, I ___.","o":["haven't","haven't got","don't"],"a":"haven't","ex":"Без got: No, I haven't."},{"t":"choice","q":"Do you have a bike? — Yes, I ___.","o":["have","do","have got"],"a":"do","ex":"Вопрос с Do → Yes, I do."},{"t":"choice","q":"She doesn't ___ a job.","o":["has","have","has got"],"a":"have","ex":"После doesn't — have."},{"t":"choice","q":"My old laptop is very ___. I can't carry it every day.","o":["light","heavy","soft"],"a":"heavy","ex":"Трудно носить → тяжёлый: heavy."},{"t":"choice","q":"This sofa is really ___. I love sitting on it.","o":["broken","comfortable","square"],"a":"comfortable","ex":"Приятно сидеть → comfortable."},{"t":"choice","q":"Everybody ___ tired after the trip.","o":["is","are"],"a":"is","ex":"После everybody — is."},{"t":"choice","q":"«У меня нет вопросов.» — I haven't got ___ questions.","o":["some","any","a"],"a":"any","ex":"Отрицание + мн. число → any."}]},{"title":"Часть B · напишите","items":[{"t":"input","q":"He has got a car.","a":["He hasn't got a car.","He has not got a car."],"ex":"has got → hasn't got.","p":"Сделайте отрицание"},{"t":"input","q":"you / a brother?","a":["Have you got a brother?"],"ex":"Have + you + got + a brother?","p":"Составьте вопрос с have got"},{"t":"input","q":"Has she got a dog?","a":["Does she have a dog?"],"ex":"Has she got → Does she have.","p":"Перепишите с do / does"},{"t":"input","q":"heavy →","a":["light"],"ex":"heavy ↔ light.","p":"Напишите противоположное прилагательное","h":"Начинается на l."}]},{"title":"Часть C · найдите ошибку и соберите","items":[{"t":"fix","q":"My sister have got a new job.","w":2,"c":"has","ex":"sister = she → has got."},{"t":"fix","q":"Do you have got a pen?","w":0,"c":"Have","ex":"С got: Have you got a pen?"},{"t":"fix","q":"I've got two news phones.","w":3,"c":"new","ex":"Прилагательное без -s."},{"t":"order","w":["have","how","cousins","got","many","you"],"a":["How many cousins have you got?"],"ex":"How many cousins + have + you + got?"},{"t":"order","w":["any","time","now","got","haven't","we"],"a":["We haven't got any time now."],"ex":"We + haven't got + any time + now."}]}]},{"id":"t4","nav":"К4 · I / you / we","eyebrow":"Контрольная 4 · урок 4","title":"Present Simple: I, you, we, they","theory":"<p>Проверка по уроку <b>4 «Present Simple: I, you, we, they»</b>. Новые задания, которых не было в уроке.</p>\n<p><b>Что проверяем:</b> утверждение · don't · Do…? и короткие ответы · свободное время · like + -ing · always … never · at / on / in · once a week · дни и м